# Wave 4 — Performance coach

## Purpose

Ranked **read-only opportunity cards** for admins from Sales, Traffic, and Fundraising data. Human decides every follow-up.

## Live surfaces

| Surface | Path |
|---------|------|
| Workspace | `/admin/agent/performance` |
| API | `GET /api/admin/agent/performance` |
| Hub summary | `GET /api/admin/agent/summary` → `performance.opportunityCount` |

## Permission

- Workspace + API: `analytics:read` **or** `agent:read` (legacy aliases apply).
- Sector registry: `lib/agent/sectors.ts` → `performance` status `live`.

## v1 card rules (`lib/agent/performanceCoach.ts`)

| ID | Trigger |
|----|---------|
| `fundraising_stale_pending` | Partner `status === pending` && created > 7 days |
| `bank_transfer_pending` | Order `paymentMethod === bank` && `status === pending` |
| `traffic_up_conversion_flat` | Last 7d pageviews ≥ prior 7d × 1.15 and conversion flat/down |
| `revenue_week_down` | This week revenue < prior week × 0.85 (prior week ≥ $50) |

## Invariants (do not regress)

- **No auto Mark Paid**, no auto price changes, no outbound sends from this wave.
- Cards link to existing admin pages only (`/admin/orders`, `/admin/traffic`, etc.).
- Homepage Hero and accounting sandbox **out of scope**.
- Pure ranking logic stays in `buildPerformanceOpportunities()` with tests.

## Do not

- Add closed-loop automation (L2/L3) without explicit product decision.
- Gate cards on LLM — v1 is deterministic rules only.
